# Manual test execution

- Agents may create or update host unit tests under `balloon-project-stm32mx/tests/host/` and document run commands in `tests/host/README.md`.
- Agents must **not** execute host unit tests, HIL scripts, Renode, or flash-and-verify loops unless the user explicitly asks in that message.
- After adding or changing tests, tell the user the exact manual run command (from `tests/host/README.md` or the guidelines doc).
- Firmware build (`make clean && make` in `balloon-project-stm32mx/`) is fine for agents when verifying compile.
